{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把“难受时想有人陪”收窄成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，动机解释比Y更强烈、更窄，失去了一点原有的细腻。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用重点加亮让观众迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，感受文字又通过缩小字号和按音乐时机出现，减少了一次性面对大量短词的负担。它对音乐变化、身体反应和情绪转折的描写更具体，旧歌、舞步、亲近记忆等线索也让十三段形成了清晰的情感回环。Y的优势是完整句子的因果解释更自然，部分心理动机保留得更准确，但整体上X更容易让普通观众边听边理解，并感受到音乐与人物经历之间的细密联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ce17676e-2d20-46fb-92c5-f96513ec714c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182813254855Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:30:12.271039+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "70f57c84e1cb8df80f1d347d821da1a9543b64b8f091a3df3bcec873d0eb4e2f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web